# Test run captures and scratch .txt output (never fixtures). Keep genuine
# .txt: build files (CMakeLists.txt) and test data (sample.txt / empty.txt).
*.txt
!CMakeLists.txt
!**/sample.txt
!**/empty.txt
# Lockfiles are never tracked: they embed machine-local resolution paths
# (e.g. an absolute Foundation path), so a committed lock breaks or leaks on
# any other checkout. Every build regenerates them.
kira.lock
.codex/worktrees/
